  "title": "Six models span search, video, text and embeddings",
  "summary": "Six new models, clearer earnings exports and fewer Claude request errors made this a fairly packed shipping day.\n\nAdded Grok 4.3 with image input, tools and reasoning; two Gemini Search models with Google Search grounding; Wan Pro for video with bundled audio; and Cohere and Qwen embedding models. Embedding requests now support up to 4096 dimensions. Six existing models also became available with free Pollen. Model cards and the video and embeddings reference were updated to match.\n\nEarnings JSON and CSV exports now include the pre-markup baseline price and the markup-inclusive amount charged to payers, from daily app rows through overall totals. The earnings reference was updated with the new fields.\n\nRequests to Claude Opus 4.7 now discard deprecated temperature, top_p and top_k settings before forwarding, avoiding 400 errors from clients that still send them.",
